# Page = sections

View and every section have `RawProps` (domain only). Wire/DTO shapes do not enter `.astro`.

Mechanics of the `.astro` file: `astro.mdc`. Glossary: `frontend/GLOSSARY.md` (Page, View, Section, Entity). ADR-0001.

## Data

Const секции и импорт во view — `.agents/skills/ui-mode/page.md` (Static, Fresh ticket, Assembly ticket).

- Page-level props = `ViewRawProps` (+ `meta` if needed).
- Entity list/detail = `I*` envelope (`entities/.../model`).
- Entity fields inside section RawProps (`reviews?: IReview[]`) — OK.

Page body sections are not article/CMS content-constructor blocks (wysiwyg body). When the user asks for a **конструктор блоков** / backend-driven order of page bands, follow skill `block-constructor` (`.agents/skills/block-constructor`): View `RawProps.sections` as a discriminated union, map/switch in the View, compose in `model/<page>-page.ts`.

```ts
export type HomeSection =
  | { type: "hero"; props: HeroSectionRawProps }
  | { type: "stats"; props: StatsSectionRawProps };

export type RawProps = {
  sections: HomeSection[];
};
```

## Placement

New section → `_pages/<Slice>/ui/<Slice>View/sections/<Name>/` until a second page needs it → `widgets/<Name>/`. `entities/<entity>/ui/` only when `I*` already exists. Slice folder omits `View` suffix; ui segment is `*View` (GLOSSARY.md).

New BEM block: layout/structure from a neighbour section OK; **not** link-reset (`color: inherit` / `text-decoration: none` / `margin: 0`) — already in `app/css/base` (`css.mdc` Reset / normalize).

## Files

- Section: `pnpm mkac Name --section --dir …`. Root `<section>` + `HTMLAttributes<'section'> & RawProps`.
- View: `HTMLAttributes<'tag'> & RawProps`. Always `RawProps`, even if the field list is still empty.
- Barrel: `export type { RawProps as NameRawProps }` — without HTML attributes.
